# Quantum-Sector Market Analytics Pipeline

![Status](https://img.shields.io/badge/status-complete-brightgreen)

An automated pipeline that tracks and analyzes publicly traded quantum computing companies (**IonQ, Rigetti, D-Wave, and Quantum Computing Inc.**) against market benchmarks (**QTUM and the S&P 500**).

It combines Python, SQL, R, Qiskit, and GitHub Actions to answer two questions:

1. How has the quantum computing sector performed as an investable market?
2. Can a quantum algorithm (**QAOA**) select a better portfolio than a classical optimization method?

**Live dashboard:** [Quantum-Sector Market Analytics](https://01a1383a-56b3-4267-e21e-7386c0905934.share.connect.posit.cloud)

